# No Autonomous Git Writes

Never run `git commit`, `git tag`, `git push`, `gh pr merge`, `glab mr merge`, or any equivalent history/publish action unless the user explicitly asks for that exact action in the current conversation.

Preparing changes is allowed: inspect status, edit files, run validation, and show the intended commit command or message. Stop before creating commits or publishing refs until the user confirms.

Do not infer permission from phrases like "fix it", "make it green", "finish up", "ship it", or "take care of it". Those allow code changes and validation, not commits or pushes.
